{"id":"60feed9537437ddc","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-top4-paracompact-space.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Paracompact Space","display":"df-zfc-top4-paracompact-space — ZFC Top4 Paracompact Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-paracompact-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-paracompact-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-paracompact-space — ZFC Top4 Paracompact Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family]]","[[58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-paracompact-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-paracompact-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-paracompact-space — ZFC Top4 Paracompact Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1be2daa6a7dea6a3\" href=\"?note=1be2daa6a7dea6a3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family\">58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ccce769ac62de4b\" href=\"?note=7ccce769ac62de4b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover\">58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a78929818a246ba\" href=\"?note=3a78929818a246ba\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union\">58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (topological carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\)</span> (open cover)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\tau\\)</span> (locally finite refinement)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S\\)</span> (cover predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ParacompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ParacompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}paracompact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4ParacompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\Bigl(X=\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal V)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}paracompact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4ParacompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\Bigl(X=\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal V)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RefinementOfCover}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every open cover has an open locally finite refinement, with both properties expressed by their exact three-place predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family","status":"resolved","id":"1be2daa6a7dea6a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover","status":"resolved","id":"7ccce769ac62de4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top4-refinement-of-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union","status":"resolved","id":"3a78929818a246ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4Locall